MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Bir nechta rasmli post (faqat rasm) lentada va post tafsilotida
  gorizontal karusel: surish, nuqtalar, bosilsa butun ekranda ko'rish.
  Video post avvalgidek bitta media.
- Ko'rgazma posti ixcham: sarlavha, narx ("125 000 so'm"), "Mahsulotni
  ko'rish" va YouTube/Instagram havolasi (faqat tashqarida ochiladi) —
  lentada ham, post tafsilotida ham (ShowcaseExtras).
- Lenta kartasida "⋯": post tafsilotidagi o'sha shikoyat va bloklash
  varag'i (biznes posti — company_post); bloklangach lenta yangilanadi;
  o'z postimda yo'q. Sarlavha qatori balandligi o'zgarmagan, vaqt
  yozuvi tor ekranda qisqaradi.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
